1358
01:27:14,830 --> 01:27:16,370
But it doesn't make you kind of a vampire, no?

1359
01:27:17,470 --> 01:27:18,270
Which can be cool.

1360
01:27:18,550 --> 01:27:19,390
I mean...

1361
01:27:21,110 --> 01:27:21,890
Ah, Ukuskivi.

1362
01:27:21,890 --> 01:27:23,450
I'm not afraid of Ukuskivi.

1363
01:27:23,730 --> 01:27:24,810
Ukuskivi's my friend now.

1364
01:27:27,470 --> 01:27:29,590
I have become one with the Ukuskivi.

1365
01:27:32,670 --> 01:27:34,110
Don't you fuck in there.

1366
01:27:35,890 --> 01:27:38,110
One of the scariest enemies in the game right there.

1367
01:27:38,950 --> 01:27:40,670
He doesn't look like much, but oh boy.

1368
01:27:43,250 --> 01:27:44,110
He's a lot, okay?

1369
01:27:44,110 --> 01:27:44,590
Give

1370
01:27:48,230 --> 01:27:50,510
me blood over here.

1371
01:27:51,590 --> 01:27:53,090
Always have a full blood bottle.

1372
01:27:55,150 --> 01:27:56,250
That's what I was taught in school.

1373
01:27:58,110 --> 01:27:59,410
Whoops, what did I just do?

1374
01:28:00,050 --> 01:28:01,970
Oh, I shot this one without thinking.

1375
01:28:05,010 --> 01:28:07,930
That could have been disastrous depending on what was in there.

1376
01:28:18,960 --> 01:28:19,340
Uh-oh.

1377
01:28:20,580 --> 01:28:22,400
Don't even think about it.

1378
01:28:23,520 --> 01:28:24,080
Kill him!

1379
01:28:24,080 --> 01:28:24,900
Oi!

1380
01:28:30,440 --> 01:28:32,920
Can you stop shooting arrows at me, please?

1381
01:28:43,420 --> 01:28:44,160
Just a bit more.

1382
01:28:47,820 --> 01:28:49,860
I wouldn't mind getting a perk all seeing eye.

1383
01:28:51,260 --> 01:28:56,680
Because, unironically, it will save me in a lot of situations because I can see the polymorph coming.

1384
01:28:59,260 --> 01:29:00,840
What I'm most scared of here is the darkness.

1385
01:29:02,500 --> 01:29:05,780
Just getting hit by a polymorph off-screen or something from someone I didn't notice?

1386
01:29:05,780 --> 01:29:08,580
God damn, that's...

1387
01:29:08,580 --> 01:29:10,500
That's very sketchy, isn't it?

1388
01:29:12,320 --> 01:29:14,140
You can tell I've been scarred.

1389
01:29:14,820 --> 01:29:16,080
Polymorph cuts deep.

1390
01:29:18,720 --> 01:29:21,120
It's something I'll carry with me for the rest of my life.

1391
01:29:23,060 --> 01:29:31,700
You know that meme or gif of the dog who has like war visions next to the donuts or whatever it is?

1392
01:29:32,330 --> 01:29:32,640
Hahaha.

1393
01:29:34,420 --> 01:29:36,120
That's me when it comes to polymorph.

1394
01:29:40,720 --> 01:29:42,180
Gotta drink a bit more here.

1395
01:29:43,080 --> 01:29:43,740
Whoopsie daisy.

1396
01:29:49,020 --> 01:29:50,320
Uh, freezing vapor?

1397
01:29:50,700 --> 01:29:50,780
Where?

1398
01:29:51,520 --> 01:29:52,280
Where'd that come from?

1399
01:29:57,760 --> 01:29:58,320
What's in here?

1400
01:30:01,820 --> 01:30:02,780
Thank you.

1401
01:30:06,150 --> 01:30:06,770
Jesus.

1402
01:30:08,090 --> 01:30:08,750
There's a lot!

1403
01:30:13,680 --> 01:30:14,640
Look at all that gold!

1404
01:30:15,840 --> 01:30:20,880
One would think that I have the perk that gives more gold, but I don't.

1405
01:30:22,740 --> 01:30:23,840
These things just drop a lot of gold.

1406
01:30:23,960 --> 01:30:25,680
I guess it's also been a while since I was down here.

1407
01:30:26,400 --> 01:30:29,080
I forgot how lucrative this area is.

1408
01:30:30,900 --> 01:30:31,260
Stop.

1409
01:30:31,680 --> 01:30:32,420
I lost a lot of health.

1410
01:30:41,160 --> 01:30:41,860
Gotta find some blood.

1411
01:30:52,680 --> 01:30:53,720
Oh wait, I should be immune to that.

1412
01:30:55,420 --> 01:30:56,800
That should count as melee, no?

1413
01:30:57,440 --> 01:30:57,440
Arrows?

1414
01:31:01,040 --> 01:31:02,700
I did say close range.

1415
01:31:04,180 --> 01:31:05,160
I'm not quite sure.

1416
01:31:05,980 --> 01:31:06,860
I'm gonna drink from the floor.

1417
01:31:11,670 --> 01:31:12,750
The sat remains.

1418
01:31:29,270 --> 01:31:29,470
That blood?

1419
01:31:29,690 --> 01:31:29,950
It is.

1420
01:31:30,230 --> 01:31:30,590
Oh yeah.

1421
01:31:32,490 --> 01:31:33,630
Very gutsy blood.

1422
01:31:35,830 --> 01:31:39,870
You can tell there's hair in there, fingernails, organs.

1423
01:31:40,350 --> 01:31:41,270
It's just nasty stuff.

1424
01:31:42,410 --> 01:31:43,670
So could I actually go this way?

1425
01:31:47,020 --> 01:31:48,140
I guess so.

1426
01:31:53,210 --> 01:31:53,750
Look at that.

1427
01:31:53,890 --> 01:31:54,230
More blood.

1428
01:31:56,190 --> 01:31:56,930
I'll take that.

1429
01:32:01,850 --> 01:32:03,070
Collect some water first.

1430
01:32:06,940 --> 01:32:07,760
Told the bottle properly.

1431
01:32:07,880 --> 01:32:08,220
There we go.

1432
01:32:08,440 --> 01:32:09,320
And now blood.

1433
01:32:21,480 --> 01:32:22,780
Wait, I've already been here.

1434
01:32:28,250 --> 01:32:29,530
That was a bit risky.

1435
01:32:29,890 --> 01:32:30,830
I shouldn't have gone in like that.

1436
01:32:33,330 --> 01:32:33,890
Hey, sweet.

1437
01:32:41,320 --> 01:32:41,980
I'm okay.

1438
01:32:48,310 --> 01:32:49,510
Come on, something good.

1439
01:32:52,670 --> 01:32:53,950
Decent wand, actually.

1440
01:32:55,510 --> 01:32:56,750
A lot of capacity too.

1441
01:32:57,950 --> 01:32:59,030
That is a sick wand.

1442
01:33:00,590 --> 01:33:01,930
Maybe I like that more than this.

1443
01:33:03,610 --> 01:33:04,010
Yeah.

1444
01:33:05,850 --> 01:33:06,830
I'll take it, thanks.

1445
01:33:21,170 --> 01:33:21,810
Give me blood.

1446
01:33:22,950 --> 01:33:25,330
Oh, I don't want goop.

1447
01:33:30,920 --> 01:33:32,340
Uh, what's happening there?

1448
01:33:34,080 --> 01:33:35,280
Did someone get polymorphed?

1449
01:33:36,380 --> 01:33:37,360
I heard the sound effect.

1450
01:33:45,840 --> 01:33:46,600
Acceleration, okay.

1451
01:33:48,400 --> 01:33:50,320
But someone did get polymorphed.

1452
01:33:51,900 --> 01:33:54,300
My ears do not deceive me.

1453
01:33:58,250 --> 01:33:59,170
Man, look at all that gold.

1454
01:34:01,230 --> 01:34:02,010
Oh, yeah.

1455
01:34:08,810 --> 01:34:13,030
There's nothing like having a wand with a speed that just hits right, you know?

1456
01:34:13,690 --> 01:34:16,170
Like this speed right here is just perfect.

1457
01:34:16,850 --> 01:34:21,450
There's no audio issues with it, it's just smooth machine gun sound.

1458
01:34:22,290 --> 01:34:22,910
So good.

1459
01:34:23,050 --> 01:34:24,630
Look at

1460
01:34:37,040 --> 01:34:37,480
that gold.

1461
01:34:38,420 --> 01:34:39,140
13k gold.

1462
01:34:40,660 --> 01:34:45,020
Actually, not even that much, considering the prices of things later on.

1463
01:34:46,340 --> 01:34:49,580
I have seen things you people wouldn't believe.

1464
01:34:51,760 --> 01:34:55,380
Prices in the range of 25 000...

1465
01:34:55,440 --> 01:34:56,040
gold.

1466
01:35:01,930 --> 01:35:05,590
Sea beams, glittering in the dark near the tenhauser gate.

1467
01:35:21,130 --> 01:35:22,550
I guess I'll go down.

1468
01:35:26,770 --> 01:35:29,070
Oh, that was a scary situation.

1469
01:35:29,970 --> 01:35:30,690
I almost got hit.

1470
01:35:32,150 --> 01:35:33,550
Did you guys fucking see that?

1471
01:35:33,710 --> 01:35:34,110
God damn.

1472
01:35:35,730 --> 01:35:40,230
I saw the color of the projectile and I just had a crazy reaction.

1473
01:35:42,670 --> 01:35:44,350
My palms were sweaty.

1474
01:35:45,770 --> 01:35:48,070
And there's definitely something to be said about...

1475
01:35:50,690 --> 01:35:52,430
But I'm not gonna utter those words here.

1476
01:35:56,290 --> 01:35:56,470
Hey.

1477
01:35:58,250 --> 01:35:59,250
What do we have down here?

1478
01:36:00,350 --> 01:36:01,150
Oh, the laboratory.

1479
01:36:08,510 --> 01:36:08,810
Oh.

1480
01:36:11,190 --> 01:36:12,070
Hold on a second.

1481
01:36:13,370 --> 01:36:14,250
Did I mark this?

1482
01:36:21,230 --> 01:36:25,130
There's this weird little... I think I've seen this multiple times, too.

1483
01:36:25,650 --> 01:36:26,710
Whoops, didn't mean to do that.

1484
01:36:29,500 --> 01:36:30,960
Uh, standard.

1485
01:36:32,700 --> 01:36:33,560
Delete that.

1486
01:36:37,480 --> 01:36:38,000
And...

1487
01:36:38,000 --> 01:36:40,380
And I'm gonna take this one.

1488
01:36:41,820 --> 01:36:43,660
I'm gonna draw a little bit of an outcropping here.

1489
01:36:49,890 --> 01:36:52,110
I wonder why it says the laboratory right there.

1490
01:36:55,950 --> 01:36:56,650
The laboratory.

1491
01:36:57,810 --> 01:37:00,990
Maybe I entered the region over here that's called laboratory or something?

1492
01:37:08,470 --> 01:37:08,730
A laboratory.

1493
01:37:11,130 --> 01:37:11,330
Nice.

1494
01:37:18,600 --> 01:37:18,840
Okay.

1495
01:37:25,310 --> 01:37:26,850
Oh, not this guy.

1496
01:37:29,530 --> 01:37:30,570
Wait, he's different somehow.

1497
01:37:34,250 --> 01:37:35,850
Sir, why are you different?

1498
01:37:48,860 --> 01:37:50,920
It's so satisfying to see them blow up, actually.

1499
01:37:51,240 --> 01:37:53,620
The sound it makes is super satisfying.

1500
01:37:56,440 --> 01:37:57,780
Something about it.

1501
01:38:06,690 --> 01:38:07,170
Uh, what is that?

1502
01:38:07,450 --> 01:38:08,490
That's acceleration, I think.

1503
01:38:15,160 --> 01:38:15,920
Oh, let me get rid of you.

1504
01:38:17,420 --> 01:38:18,020
There we go.

1505
01:38:24,310 --> 01:38:24,970
You bastard.

1506
01:38:32,390 --> 01:38:34,630
Uh, I wonder if electricity can trigger those crystals.

1507
01:38:36,570 --> 01:38:37,330
I doubt it.

1508
01:38:44,790 --> 01:38:44,970
Okay.

1509
01:38:45,370 --> 01:38:46,390
Man, where's the end here?

1510
01:38:56,310 --> 01:38:56,770
Oh, but wait a minute.

1511
01:38:56,910 --> 01:38:57,970
Wasn't there something on the left?

1512
01:38:59,270 --> 01:38:59,990
That I could do here?

1513
01:39:08,810 --> 01:39:09,630
Oh, wait a minute.

1514
01:39:10,710 --> 01:39:11,550
Oh, wait, I'm not here.

1515
01:39:12,090 --> 01:39:12,490
I'm here.

1516
01:39:14,270 --> 01:39:14,610
Whoops.

1517
01:39:15,350 --> 01:39:15,610
Hold on.

1518
01:39:16,310 --> 01:39:16,830
Mistakes were made.

1519
01:39:18,950 --> 01:39:19,270
Back.

1520
01:39:20,150 --> 01:39:20,870
I am here.

1521
01:39:22,130 --> 01:39:24,070
I was uh, I was about to say I want to go here now.

1522
01:39:24,810 --> 01:39:26,250
Because that is the way to go back up.

1523
01:39:27,910 --> 01:39:28,210
Okay.

1524
01:39:31,110 --> 01:39:32,630
Good, so this is actually the last.

1525
01:39:34,530 --> 01:39:36,010
Then there's a wizard stand on the right.

1526
01:39:37,690 --> 01:39:39,190
Yeah, we gotta go here and do this.

1527
01:39:40,790 --> 01:39:41,750
Because I don't have any digging.

1528
01:39:42,090 --> 01:39:42,810
That's the only way up.

1529
01:39:43,390 --> 01:39:44,590
The only way up is to go down.

1530
01:39:45,310 --> 01:39:46,250
Or in this case, left.

1531
01:39:48,930 --> 01:39:49,750
To the tower.

1532
01:39:53,870 --> 01:39:54,630
The tower.

1533
01:39:55,730 --> 01:39:58,670
With all the different layers of danger.

1534
01:40:02,630 --> 01:40:03,270
Very cool.

1535
01:40:05,570 --> 01:40:06,410
Up and left.

1536
01:40:07,670 --> 01:40:09,590
There is a chance I may not get here.

1537
01:40:09,850 --> 01:40:11,390
Because if it's blocked off and I can't dig.

1538
01:40:13,190 --> 01:40:14,990
Let's cross that bridge when we get to it.

1539
01:40:19,780 --> 01:40:20,120
Let's go.

1540
01:40:22,420 --> 01:40:23,360
Ah, that thing's about to explode.

1541
01:40:27,780 --> 01:40:28,400
Actually, hold on.

1542
01:40:29,440 --> 01:40:30,220
Uh, whoops.

1543
01:40:30,740 --> 01:40:31,880
I just touched the teleportation.

1544
01:40:37,790 --> 01:40:38,510
Oh, that's lava.

1545
01:40:39,370 --> 01:40:40,270
Oh, wait a minute.

1546
01:40:42,050 --> 01:40:49,330
I was just about to say actually, should I probably not go down to the next level and get a perk before I go up?

1547
01:40:49,430 --> 01:40:51,170
But the thing is, I can't go back up then.

1548
01:40:51,870 --> 01:40:54,050
I need some kind of way to dig.

1549
01:40:54,230 --> 01:40:55,030
Just a little bit.

1550
01:40:55,090 --> 01:40:57,390
I need to be able to dig through just a little bit.

1551
01:40:58,350 --> 01:40:59,230
Of brickwork.

1552
01:41:01,410 --> 01:41:02,610
Maybe I'll find something here.

1553
01:41:04,650 --> 01:41:05,430
To do that.

1554
01:41:05,930 --> 01:41:08,390
I really want to grab that perk before I go up.

1555
01:41:08,390 --> 01:41:10,390
You know, it feels like a ways not to take it.

1556
01:41:10,590 --> 01:41:11,630
It's a whole perk, man.

1557
01:41:11,750 --> 01:41:12,470
Could change everything.

1558
01:41:17,590 --> 01:41:18,010
Oh, hello.

1559
01:41:18,650 --> 01:41:19,050
Stop that.

1560
01:41:21,430 --> 01:41:22,210
Did I see a guy?

1561
01:41:22,370 --> 01:41:22,830
I saw a guy.

1562
01:41:23,890 --> 01:41:25,030
Oh, he's not the scary one though.

1563
01:41:25,450 --> 01:41:26,710
He's kind of scary, but he's not that scary.

1564
01:41:33,270 --> 01:41:34,150
You know, I'll take a bit of blood.

1565
01:41:36,070 --> 01:41:36,830
For the road.

1566
01:41:51,210 --> 01:41:51,530
Aha!

1567
01:41:52,910 --> 01:41:53,550
You bastard.

1568
01:42:02,370 --> 01:42:02,690
Oh, yeah.

1569
01:42:05,250 --> 01:42:05,790
Oh, shit.

1570
01:42:07,170 --> 01:42:07,750
Actually, hold on.

1571
01:42:07,870 --> 01:42:08,650
That guy's not that scary.

1572
01:42:08,810 --> 01:42:10,310
If I don't do anything to him, he's not gonna hurt me.

1573
01:42:11,010 --> 01:42:11,210
Remember?

1574
01:42:11,330 --> 01:42:11,910
He's actually okay.

1575
01:42:12,030 --> 01:42:12,090
Look.

1576
01:42:14,010 --> 01:42:14,770
We're totally chilling.

1577
01:42:16,070 --> 01:42:17,130
No need to go nuts here.

1578
01:42:18,230 --> 01:42:21,550
So, at least he doesn't return the projectiles like the other guy.

1579
01:42:21,990 --> 01:42:23,870
He just starts to lead fire, it seems.

1580
01:42:25,250 --> 01:42:25,850
I'm okay with that.

1581
01:42:30,210 --> 01:42:31,430
Oh, did he just get blown up?

1582
01:42:32,170 --> 01:42:32,270
Amazing.

1583
01:42:39,940 --> 01:42:40,420
Hello.

1584
01:42:49,390 --> 01:42:49,970
Who else wants some?

1585
01:42:53,820 --> 01:42:54,320
It's weird.

1586
01:42:54,460 --> 01:42:56,800
I'm getting accustomed to the increased levitation speed.

1587
01:42:57,440 --> 01:42:59,220
I never thought that would happen, but it has happened.

1588
01:43:00,560 --> 01:43:02,440
I'm used to it.

1589
01:43:03,380 --> 01:43:05,440
Gonna be so weird going back now.

1590
01:43:14,420 --> 01:43:15,320
Oh, what's that?

1591
01:43:15,840 --> 01:43:16,400
Worm pheromone?

1592
01:43:16,740 --> 01:43:17,220
No.

1593
01:43:24,700 --> 01:43:26,300
That does hurt me.

1594
01:43:38,170 --> 01:43:38,690
Green is cursed.

1595
01:43:39,030 --> 01:43:39,430
Green is cursed.

1596
01:43:42,370 --> 01:43:43,990
Ah, a wand.

1597
01:43:47,470 --> 01:43:48,530
Not that great.

1598
01:43:48,970 --> 01:43:52,670
I mean, stats are actually decent, but I don't want any of this.

1599
01:43:54,990 --> 01:43:55,890
Don't want the eggs.

1600
01:43:59,050 --> 01:44:00,810
Even though there is no use for eggs, actually.

1601
01:44:08,070 --> 01:44:10,350
I kind of want to find just a couple more hearts, if I can.

1602
01:44:11,470 --> 01:44:12,890
Or, of course, black holes.

1603
01:44:13,690 --> 01:44:15,410
Black hole would be amazing right now.

1604
01:44:16,290 --> 01:44:18,110
Or even like a healing spell.

1605
01:44:23,650 --> 01:44:27,910
I mean, I still have vampirism, but the healing spell is for late game, you know?

1606
01:44:28,050 --> 01:44:30,090
It needs something more substantial than that.

1607
01:44:30,530 --> 01:44:32,790
Especially if I start to approach...

1608
01:44:32,790 --> 01:44:33,430
I don't know.

1609
01:44:33,990 --> 01:44:35,090
500 HP, you know?

1610
01:44:36,470 --> 01:44:38,650
Or even like a million.

1611
01:44:40,510 --> 01:44:41,250
That's a lot.

1612
01:44:50,090 --> 01:44:52,710
I keep taking little bits of chip damage here.

1613
01:44:52,810 --> 01:44:53,090
It's annoying.

1614
01:45:05,840 --> 01:45:06,160
What's up, fools?

1615
01:45:09,450 --> 01:45:11,530
Again, I lost so much there.

1616
01:45:12,350 --> 01:45:13,950
That crystal is no joke.

1617
01:45:15,830 --> 01:45:17,450
Really gotta watch out for that one.

1618
01:45:24,960 --> 01:45:26,060
Yeah, go up here.

1619
01:45:32,390 --> 01:45:33,190
What do we got?

1620
01:45:39,330 --> 01:45:39,850
Bastard.

1621
01:45:45,710 --> 01:45:46,270
Oh no, dead end.

1622
01:45:47,270 --> 01:45:48,130
I want to destroy that.

1623
01:45:49,330 --> 01:45:49,810
I'm coming.

1624
01:45:57,350 --> 01:45:58,690
Oh, it's so painful without digging.

1625
01:46:02,380 --> 01:46:02,620
Aha!

1626
01:46:02,620 --> 01:46:02,900
Aha!

1627
01:46:04,020 --> 01:46:04,740
Very nice.

1628
01:46:11,550 --> 01:46:12,410
